    "data": {
      "id": 2163,
      "hub_id": 2864,
      "guid": null,
      "name": "ZLR GRAU 556 & 762 Assault rifle",
      "slug": "zlr-grau-556-762-assault-rifle",
      "teaser": "A fictional SG-550 series rifle, with 5.56*45 & 7.62*39 versions.",
      "thumbnail": "https://forge-static.sp-tarkov.com/mods/2864.webp",
      "downloads": 4730,
      "favourites_count": 0,
      "description": "<div class=\"tabset\"><div id=\"tabset-1-panel-1\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">Overview</div>\n<div class=\"tab-content\"><p>In the cursed lands of Novinsk, 7.62×39mm cartridges were forever doomed to cycle through 600–650 RPM weapons. That changed when someone broke the timeline, returning with a forbidden GRAU 5.56 rifle—converted to 7.62×39 through unholy means.</p>\n<p>This mod introduces a high-RPM Grau rifle adapted for the 7.62×39 cartridge, bringing modern customization and firepower to your arsenal.</p>\n<p>- Base rifle supports 720 RPM.</p>\n<p>- Built with modularity in mind—capable of everything from a basic carbine to a high-precision marksman rifle.</p>\n<p>- Models and textures sourced from Call of Duty by Infinity Ward.</p>\n<p><a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://hub.sp-tarkov.com/attachment/8661-%E5%B1%8F%E5%B9%95%E6%88%AA%E5%9B%BE-2024-06-16-155154-png/\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://hub.sp-tarkov.com/attachment/8661-%E5%B1%8F%E5%B9%95%E6%88%AA%E5%9B%BE-2024-06-16-155154-png/?thumbnail=1\" alt=\"?thumbnail=1\" /></a></p>\n<p>Not only ported a 720 RPM rifle, also with bunches of assessories:</p>\n<p><a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://hub.sp-tarkov.com/attachment/8663-%E5%B1%8F%E5%B9%95%E6%88%AA%E5%9B%BE-2024-07-28-091533-png/\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://hub.sp-tarkov.com/attachment/8663-%E5%B1%8F%E5%B9%95%E6%88%AA%E5%9B%BE-2024-07-28-091533-png/?thumbnail=1\" alt=\"?thumbnail=1\" /></a></p>\n<p>Now we’ ve ported another Grau rifle, check this photo for detail:</p>\n<p><a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://hub.sp-tarkov.com/attachment/8797-%E5%B1%8F%E5%B9%95%E6%88%AA%E5%9B%BE-2024-08-07-130157-png/\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://hub.sp-tarkov.com/attachment/8797-%E5%B1%8F%E5%B9%95%E6%88%AA%E5%9B%BE-2024-08-07-130157-png/?thumbnail=1\" alt=\"?thumbnail=1\" /></a></p>\n<p>So you have opportunities to customize the rifle from boltgun to highly precisive maskman rifle.</p>\n<p><a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://hub.sp-tarkov.com/attachment/8798-%E5%B1%8F%E5%B9%95%E6%88%AA%E5%9B%BE-2024-07-28-092704-png/\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://hub.sp-tarkov.com/attachment/8798-%E5%B1%8F%E5%B9%95%E6%88%AA%E5%9B%BE-2024-07-28-092704-png/?thumbnail=1\" alt=\"?thumbnail=1\" /></a><a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://hub.sp-tarkov.com/attachment/8799-%E5%B1%8F%E5%B9%95%E6%88%AA%E5%9B%BE-2024-08-07-110443-png/\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://hub.sp-tarkov.com/attachment/8799-%E5%B1%8F%E5%B9%95%E6%88%AA%E5%9B%BE-2024-08-07-110443-png/?thumbnail=1\" alt=\"?thumbnail=1\" /></a></p></div></div>\n<div id=\"tabset-1-panel-2\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">Setup and Usage</div>\n<div class=\"tab-content\"><p>1. Unzip the downloaded files.</p>\n<p>2. Drop the mod folder into your SPT directory.</p>\n<p>3. Launch the game.</p>\n<p>4. Visit Mechanic’s shop or browse the Flea Market to find the Grau rifle and its attachments.</p>\n<p>**Note for MPT/Fika users:**</p>\n<p>If you experience bundle loading issues (e.g., white textures or errors), manually place the bundle files:</p>\n<p>- Copy <code>/user/mods/\\[this mod name\\]/\\[this mod name\\]/bundles</code></p>\n<p>- Merge into <code>/user/cache/</code> under the matching folder.</p>\n<p>This fix applies to all my mods.</p></div></div>\n<div id=\"tabset-1-panel-3\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">Permissions and Legal</div>\n<div class=\"tab-content\"><p>- Do not reupload or redistribute <code>.bundle</code> files from this mod without permission.</p>\n<p>- You may share or modify the mod, but please credit the original authors.</p>\n<p>- Respect all associated IPs.</p>\n<p>**Assets Credits:**</p>\n<p>- Models, Textures, Sounds: Infinity Ward (Call of Duty series)</p>\n<p>- Conversion and Bundling: <a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://hub.sp-tarkov.com/user/53479-saintdeer/\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">saintdeer</a></p>\n<p>- Additional Animation and Asset Work: Massivesoft</p>\n<p>- Base Code Structure: Mighty_Condor</p></div></div>\n<div id=\"tabset-1-panel-4\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">Credits</div>\n<div class=\"tab-content\"><p>- Models, Textures, Sounds: Infinity Ward (Call of Duty)</p>\n<p>- Porting, Conversion, Texture Work: <a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://hub.sp-tarkov.com/user/53479-saintdeer/\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">saintdeer</a></p>\n<p>- Reloaded Animations, Sounds, Bundling: Massivesoft</p>\n<p>- Code Structure: Mighty_Condor</p></div></div></div>\n",
